<figure id="S3.T4" class="ltx_table">
<figcaption class="ltx_caption"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_table">Table 4: </span>Performance comparison of three open-sourced LALMs across token pruning methods and ratios on AudioMarathon tasks, grouped into Speech Content Extraction (SER, SCR, ASR), Audio Classification (SED, MC, ASC), and Speaker Recognition (SD, ER, SAR, SGR). F1-score (0-100) is the primary metric, except for ASR, where Word Accuracy Rate (WAR) is used. The Avg. column shows the mean score across available tasks. Best scores within each pruning ratio are in <span id="S3.T4.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">bold</span>.</figcaption>
