<p id="A1.SS1.p1.1" class="ltx_p">The Table <a href="#A1.T6" title="Table 6 ‣ A.1 Random Choice Baseline ‣ Appendix A Additional Results ‣ AudioMarathon: A Comprehensive Benchmark for Long-Context Audio Understanding and Efficiency in Audio LLMs" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">6</span></a>
illustrates that the F1-scores are lower, directly reflecting the validity of using F1-score as an evaluation metric, highlighting its ability to balance precision and recall.</p>
